'''BigBst4tz2''' was a [[Default Knife]] skin made by [[didi1147]]. It was designed and published on October 1, 2016 and was most likely meant to be released as part of the YouTuber Set as a code. However, due to unknown circumstances, it was scrapped and never made it to the game.

==Appearance ==
Its blade is purple in color with blue lightning striking at the tip. Near the ricasso is [[community:c:youtube:BigBst4tz2|BigBst4tz2’s]] logo looking up at five chocolate chip cookies levitating to the lightning near the center of the blade. The guard is cyan in color, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia== 
*It is based off the actual YouTuber [[w:c:youtube:BigBst4tz2|BigBst4tz2]].<ref>https://www.roblox.com/library/513368309/cookie-knife</ref>

